{"t": 1794110991.2504542, "kind": "call", "tool": "slack_post_message", "args": {"channel_id": "C07INCID003", "text": "reports-api 502s \u2014 root cause found.\n\nCloudWatch `/ecs/reports-api` (eu-west-1) shows the export failing with `ValueError: dict contains fields not in fieldnames: 'currency'`, immediately after `INFO upstream ledger 2026.11 added currency to every row`. `reports/export.py` hardcoded the CSV columns to id/amount, so every export raised and the API answered 502.\n\nFix prepared in `reports/export.py`: the export now includes `currency` and ignores other unexpected upstream fields (reproduced the exact ValueError and verified the patched output locally).\n\nNeeds a deploy of reports-api. After deploy, please verify a sample export and watch the 502 rate. Note: this legacy service has no Sentry project/alerts \u2014 its logs are only in CloudWatch `/ecs/reports-api`."}, "ok": true}
